**Read:** [Industrial Chemical Technology I — Adebayo, NOUN](../sources/Industrial-Chemical-Technology-I-NOUN.lingua#r_2026VMVXVJQGK3WTH1P17FE8T9), the whole text, beginning with the course guide and introductory units; [Industrial Chemical Technology II — Nduka, NOUN](../sources/Industrial-Chemical-Technology-II-NOUN.lingua#r_7RXE2GF1DW7QH9GHTCGT0P09SR), the complete three-module text as the product cases develop; [Inorganic Chemical Technology — Nanda Kishore, NPTEL](../sources/Inorganic-Chemical-Technology-Kishore.lingua#r_77Z8T5RFYFNNXZ7XKZFKPRKDKR), the whole public programme; [Organic Chemical Technology — Nanda Kishore, NPTEL](../sources/Organic-Chemical-Technology-Kishore.lingua#r_1ERYESBGNKCKMDY0NPHJKCVJG0), the whole public programme; [Chemical Reactor Analysis and Design Fundamentals — Rawlings and Ekerdt](../sources/Chemical-Reactor-Analysis-Rawlings-Ekerdt.lingua#r_7YQAV27Y3J0B537Z6K5HDN8H0A), the complete book, examples and substantial exercises across the later progression.

Begin with an ordinary product and the question in the next Record. Read the complete NOUN CHM316 and CHM415 texts as an accessible orientation, checking equations and quantities as they arise. Their concise units introduce a language for much larger work; unfamiliar substances, units or equations lead into [General chemistry](../../general-chemistry/General-chemistry.lingua#r_206GS6CVXD8WSY1VX7PRF7136V), [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2) and [Measurement and metrology](../../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5) at the point needed.

Complete the entire public Inorganic Chemical Technology and Organic Chemical Technology progressions. Read the whole Rawlings/Ekerdt book, working its problems as balances, thermodynamics, kinetics and reactors develop. The full MIT undergraduate reaction programme and later graduate thermodynamics/numerical programmes provide increasingly demanding derivations and independent calculations. Companion Mall material and optional commercial whole-book routes add further process comparisons.

Read all six USP apostilas during the natural-product cases. The later inorganic, organic, batch/specialty, polymer, refinery, water/gas, steam, renewable-feed and primary-paper studies use whole technical books or complete pertinent chapters rather than a collection of abstracts. [Complete substantial chemical-technology books, university work and connected process studies](../research/A-sustained-industrial-chemistry-reading-and-practice-programme.lingua#r_5JE464G1MT1B1153AD87X7JS90) names this sustained reading and work. [Industrial chemistry sources — whole books, courses, technical methods and primary evidence](../Sources.lingua#r_3084780FHMK499ZDAW07TYA3TQ) preserves actual editions, access and rights.

The later laboratory, process-family, model, thermal, integrated-system and independent scholarly studies demand documented evidence and revision. A literature/supplied-data study can develop deep interpretation and computation while reporting precisely which physical work was performed. Each Record supplies a next explanation or study, with shared foundations available whenever needed.

**Continue:** [Begin with a useful chemical product and the work that gives it its properties](A-product-and-the-chemistry-that-makes-it.lingua#r_0E0P0DQW2WSW99ENJSBQNFH01B).

